---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
export const prerender = false;
---
<html lang="en-GB"><head><BaseHead title="Traffic management work packs | Trades Go Digital" description="Create a Chapter 8 traffic-management work pack for a specific road, closure and works location." /></head><body><Header/><main class="workspace"><a href="/health-and-safety">← Health &amp; Safety</a><p class="eyebrow">SAFEWORK AI / TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT</p><h1>Create a traffic-management work pack</h1><p class="intro">Choose the type of traffic-management job first. The form will then ask for the location and controls that apply to that job. Your paid pack is generated only after Stripe confirms payment.</p><ol class="steps"><li><b>1</b> Job type and road</li><li><b>2</b> Closure and layout</li><li><b>3</b> Emergency details</li><li><b>4</b> Review and pay</li></ol><form id="tm-form"><fieldset class="job-type"><legend>Choose the traffic-management job</legend><div class="job-type-options"><label><input type="radio" name="jobType" value="motorway-lane-closure" required> <span><strong>Motorway or dual-carriageway lane closure</strong><small>Uses direction, lanes, marker posts or chainage, Chapter 8 design and static/mobile closure controls.</small></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="jobType" value="portable-traffic-lights" required> <span><strong>Portable traffic-light job</strong><small>Uses road names, junctions, property or landmark limits, approved signal settings and Red Book controls.</small></span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Company and workforce</legend><div class="grid"><label>Company name<input name="company" required maxlength="200"></label><label>Company address <span>(optional)</span><input name="companyAddress" maxlength="500"></label><label>Contact telephone <span>(optional)</span><input name="contact" type="tel" maxlength="200"></label><label>Number of workers<input name="workerCount" type="number" min="1" max="50" value="4" required></label></div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Road and exact works limits</legend><div class="grid"><label>Road number / name<input name="road" required placeholder="A12 or London Road, Colchester"></label><label>Direction<select name="direction" required><option value="">Select direction</option><option value="Northbound (N/B)">Northbound (N/B)</option><option value="Southbound (S/B)">Southbound (S/B)</option><option value="Eastbound (E/B)">Eastbound (E/B)</option><option value="Westbound (W/B)">Westbound (W/B)</option><option value="Both directions">Both directions</option></select></label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden>Start marker post / chainage<input name="startMarker" placeholder="10/01"></label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden>End marker post / chainage<input name="endMarker" placeholder="12/01"></label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden>Start of traffic-light works<input name="startLimit" placeholder="Outside number 18 London Road"></label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden>End of traffic-light works<input name="endLimit" placeholder="25 m beyond the Station Road junction"></label><label>Carriageway / lanes affected<input name="lanes" required placeholder="Lane 2 southbound or shuttle working in both directions"></label><label>Speed limit<input name="speed" required placeholder="30 mph"></label><label>Nearest junction / landmark<input name="landmark" required placeholder="Junction with Station Road"></label><label>Planned date, time and duration<input name="duration" required placeholder="16 September, 09:30–15:30"></label></div><p class="field-help motorway-only conditional" hidden>Use marker posts or chainage for the motorway or dual-carriageway limits.</p><p class="field-help lights-only conditional" hidden>For traffic lights, identify both ends using road names, junctions, property numbers or clear landmarks. Marker posts are not required.</p><label>Traffic-management activity<textarea name="activity" required rows="4" minlength="40" placeholder="Describe the traffic-management installation, maintenance, alteration and removal work."></textarea></label><label>Work taking place inside the closure<textarea name="insideWork" required rows="3" placeholder="Briefly describe the contractor's activity. This will provide context only and will not create RAMS for their work."></textarea></label><label>How could that work affect the TM crew?<textarea name="interfaceRisks" required rows="3" placeholder="For example moving or reversing plant, excavations, lifting, hot work, overhead work, electricity, dust, fumes, noise or changes to the closure."></textarea></label></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Depot preparation and site assessment</legend><p>Record how the person in charge will organise the crew, vehicles and equipment before leaving the yard, then confirm the actual road and traffic conditions before installation.</p><label>Depot briefing and crew allocation<textarea name="depotBriefing" required rows="3" placeholder="Name the person in charge and operatives; allocate vehicles, call signs, communications, rendezvous and responsibilities."></textarea></label><label>Equipment and loading plan<textarea name="yardChecks" required rows="3" placeholder="Equipment schedule and loading order; signs, cones, barriers, lamps, signals where selected, radios, PPE, first aid, drawings, permits and record forms."></textarea></label><div class="grid"><label>Road type<select name="roadType" required><option value="">Select road type</option><option>Motorway</option><option>High-speed dual carriageway</option><option>Other dual carriageway</option><option>Single carriageway</option><option>Urban street</option></select></label><label>Expected traffic, queues and peak conditions<input name="queues" required></label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden>Traffic-count date and time<input name="countDateTime" placeholder="15 September, 19:00–19:03"></label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden>Count duration and method<input name="countMethod" placeholder="3-minute classified count at marker 10/01"></label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden>Traffic count result<input name="trafficFlow" placeholder="Cars 55; HGVs 12; total 67"></label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden>Approved maximum flow / go-no-go limit<input name="flowLimit" placeholder="Copy from approved method/design"></label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden>Number of signal approaches<select name="signalApproaches"><option value="">Select approaches</option><option>Two-way shuttle working</option><option>Three-way junction control</option><option>Four-way junction control</option></select></label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden>Signal operating mode<select name="signalMode"><option value="">Select mode</option><option>Vehicle-actuated</option><option>Fixed-time to approved settings</option><option>Manual control as authorised</option></select></label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden>Signal supplier and fault contact<input name="signalSupplier" placeholder="Company and 24-hour fault number"></label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden>Approved timing / design reference<input name="signalTimingRef" placeholder="Copy the reference; do not calculate timings here"></label></div><label>Site survey findings<textarea name="roadSurvey" required rows="4" placeholder="Road width and lanes, forward visibility, bends/crests, junctions, accesses, bus stops, vulnerable users, overhead hazards and nearby works."></textarea></label><label>Weather, lighting and surface conditions<textarea name="conditions" required rows="3" placeholder="Forecast and actual visibility, darkness, glare, wind, rain, spray, fog, ice, heat, cold or standing water."></textarea></label><label>Actions if weather or visibility changes<textarea name="weatherActions" required rows="3" placeholder="Extra inspections, securing equipment, lighting changes, method changes, suspension limits and who can stop the operation."></textarea></label><label>Safe installation and removal method<textarea name="deployment" required rows="4" placeholder="Use the approved sequence and protected working positions. Include commissioning or drive-through inspection, maintenance, removal and the final road check as applicable."></textarea></label></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Closure and approved arrangement</legend><p>Choose every arrangement included in the approved design.</p><div class="ticks"><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden><input type="checkbox" name="arrangement" value="Static lane closure"> Static lane closure</label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden><input type="checkbox" name="arrangement" value="Mobile lane closure (MLC)"> Mobile lane closure (MLC)</label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden><input type="checkbox" name="arrangement" value="Full road closure"> Full road closure</label><label class="motorway-only conditional" hidden><input type="checkbox" name="arrangement" value="Hard-shoulder closure"> Hard-shoulder closure</label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden><input type="radio" name="signalArrangement" value="Portable two-way traffic signals"> Portable two-way traffic lights</label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden><input type="radio" name="signalArrangement" value="Portable multi-way traffic signals"> Portable multi-way traffic lights</label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden><input type="checkbox" name="arrangement" value="Signed diversion route"> Signed diversion where approved</label><label class="lights-only conditional" hidden><input type="checkbox" name="arrangement" value="Multi-phase staged traffic-management layout"> Multi-phase / staged layout</label></div><div class="red-book lights-only conditional" hidden><strong>Portable traffic-light installation checks</strong><span>Use only where the road is within the Red Book’s scope and the actual site matches the approved layout.</span><span>Record the highway-authority approval, signal/controller identification and approved settings or design reference.</span><span>Confirm signal-head positions and visibility, signing, guarding, pedestrian routes, property access and emergency access.</span><span>Commission the system, prevent conflicting greens, monitor queues and record inspections, faults, changes and final removal.</span><span>Do not invent timings, distances or site approval. Copy them from the approved design and authority documents.</span></div><div class="grid"><label>Highway authority / client<input name="authority" required></label><label>TM drawing number and revision<input name="drawing" required></label><label>Road-space booking / permit reference<input name="roadspace" required></label><label>Traffic order / notice / signal approval<input name="orderRef" required placeholder="Enter reference or state not applicable"></label></div><label>Phase sequence and changeover method<textarea name="phases" required rows="4" placeholder="State single phase if applicable. For multiple phases, copy the approved limits and safe changeover method."></textarea></label><label>Approved layout details<textarea name="layout" required rows="4" placeholder="Copy works length, signs, cones, barriers, lamps, safety zones and signal settings from the approved drawing; do not estimate."></textarea></label><label>Pedestrian, cyclist, property and emergency access<textarea name="access" required rows="3"></textarea></label><div class="grid"><label>TM designer / organisation<input name="designer" required></label><label>TM supervisor / foreman<input name="supervisor" required></label><label>Installation team competence<input name="competence" required placeholder="Relevant cards, training and roles"></label><label>Inspection frequency<input name="inspections" required></label></div></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend>Emergency information</legend><div class="grid"><label>Site emergency contact<input name="siteEmergencyContact" required></label><label>Contact telephone<input name="siteEmergencyPhone" type="tel" required></label><label>First aider<input name="firstAider" required></label><label>First aider telephone<input name="firstAiderPhone" type="tel" required></label><label>Nearest hospital / A&amp;E<input name="hospital" required></label><label>Hospital address and postcode<input name="hospitalAddress" required></label></div><label>Breakdown, collision, failed signals and emergency-access plan<textarea name="emergencyPlan" required rows="4"></textarea></label></fieldset>
<div class="notice"><strong>Check the approved information before payment.</strong> The pack will contain blank operational records and signature boxes, but it cannot grant a road-space booking, traffic order, signal approval or Chapter 8 design approval.</div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewAccepted" required> I understand this is an AI-generated draft that must be checked by a competent traffic-management person before use.</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="processingAccepted" required> I agree to send these job details to OpenAI to prepare the pack and store the order with Trades Go Digital.</label><button id="review" type="submit">Review details and price →</button></form><section id="confirmation" hidden><h2>Review before payment</h2><pre id="summary"></pre><p id="total"></p><button id="pay">Create order</button> <button id="edit" class="secondary">Edit details</button></section><p id="message" role="status"></p><section id="recovery" hidden><h2>Your order is saved</h2><a id="order-link">Open private order link</a><p><a id="stripe-link" class="button">Pay securely with Stripe →</a></p></section></main><Footer/>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#tm-form')!, confirmation=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#confirmation')!, msg=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#message')!;let payload:Record<string,unknown>={},price='£14.99';
const value=(d:FormData,n:string)=>String(d.get(n)||'').trim();const jobTypeInputs=[...form.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="jobType"]')];const updateJobType=()=>{const jobType=jobTypeInputs.find(input=>input.checked)?.value||'', motorway=jobType==='motorway-lane-closure', lights=jobType==='portable-traffic-lights';form.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.motorway-only').forEach(element=>element.hidden=!motorway);form.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.lights-only').forEach(element=>element.hidden=!lights);form.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement|HTMLSelectElement|HTMLTextAreaElement>('.conditional input,.conditional select,.conditional textarea').forEach(control=>{const active=!control.closest<HTMLElement>('.conditional')?.hidden;control.disabled=!active;control.required=active&&['startMarker','endMarker','countDateTime','countMethod','trafficFlow','flowLimit','startLimit','endLimit','signalArrangement','signalApproaches','signalMode','signalSupplier','signalTimingRef'].includes(control.name)});if(motorway)form.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="signalArrangement"]').forEach(input=>input.checked=false);if(lights)form.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input[name="arrangement"]').forEach(input=>input.checked=false)};jobTypeInputs.forEach(input=>input.addEventListener('change',updateJobType));updateJobType();form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const d=new FormData(form),jobType=value(d,'jobType'),arrangements=[...d.getAll('arrangement').map(String),...d.getAll('signalArrangement').map(String)];if(!arrangements.length){msg.textContent='Choose the closure or traffic-light arrangement.';return;}const motorway=jobType==='motorway-lane-closure',limits=motorway?`marker post / chainage ${value(d,'startMarker')} to ${value(d,'endMarker')}`:`from ${value(d,'startLimit')} to ${value(d,'endLimit')}`;const road=`${value(d,'road')} ${value(d,'direction')}, ${value(d,'lanes')}, ${limits}`;const assessment=motorway?`count ${value(d,'countDateTime')}, ${value(d,'countMethod')}; result ${value(d,'trafficFlow')}; approved go/no-go limit ${value(d,'flowLimit')}`:`portable-signal approaches ${value(d,'signalApproaches')}; operating mode ${value(d,'signalMode')}; supplier/fault contact ${value(d,'signalSupplier')}; approved timing/design reference ${value(d,'signalTimingRef')}`;const planning=[`TRAFFIC-MANAGEMENT JOB TYPE: ${motorway?'MOTORWAY OR DUAL-CARRIAGEWAY LANE CLOSURE':'PORTABLE TRAFFIC-LIGHT JOB WITHIN RED BOOK ROAD SCOPE'}`,`TRAFFIC-MANAGEMENT JOB: ${value(d,'activity')}`,`WORK INSIDE THE CLOSURE - CONTEXT ONLY, NOT CONTRACTOR RAMS: ${value(d,'insideWork')}`,`INTERFACE RISKS TO THE TM CREW FROM THAT WORK: ${value(d,'interfaceRisks')}`,`Exact road and limits: ${road}; nearest junction/landmark: ${value(d,'landmark')}; speed limit: ${value(d,'speed')}`,`Planned date/time/duration: ${value(d,'duration')}`,`Depot briefing and crew allocation: ${value(d,'depotBriefing')}`,`Equipment and loading plan: ${value(d,'yardChecks')}`,`Traffic and site assessment: road type ${value(d,'roadType')}; ${assessment}; queues/peak conditions ${value(d,'queues')}; survey ${value(d,'roadSurvey')}; conditions ${value(d,'conditions')}; actions if conditions change ${value(d,'weatherActions')}`,`Installation and removal method: ${value(d,'deployment')}`,`Selected arrangement: ${arrangements.join('; ')}`,`Highway authority/client: ${value(d,'authority')}`,`TM drawing/revision: ${value(d,'drawing')}`,`Road-space booking/permit: ${value(d,'roadspace')}`,`Traffic order/notice/signal approval: ${value(d,'orderRef')}`,`Phase sequence/changeover: ${value(d,'phases')}`,`Approved layout details: ${value(d,'layout')}`,`Road-user/property/emergency access: ${value(d,'access')}`,`Designer: ${value(d,'designer')}; supervisor: ${value(d,'supervisor')}; competence: ${value(d,'competence')}; inspections: ${value(d,'inspections')}`,`Emergency plan: ${value(d,'emergencyPlan')}`];payload={company:value(d,'company'),companyAddress:value(d,'companyAddress'),contact:value(d,'contact'),workerCount:Number(d.get('workerCount')),trialHoleSheets:1,address:road,description:planning.join('\n'),emergency:`Site emergency contact: ${value(d,'siteEmergencyContact')}: ${value(d,'siteEmergencyPhone')}\nFirst aider: ${value(d,'firstAider')}: ${value(d,'firstAiderPhone')}\nHospital 1: ${value(d,'hospital')}: ${value(d,'hospitalAddress')}`,reviewAccepted:d.has('reviewAccepted'),processingAccepted:d.has('processingAccepted')};document.querySelector('#summary')!.textContent=planning.join('\n\n');form.hidden=true;confirmation.hidden=false;msg.textContent='';confirmation.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});});
let checkoutPrices={motorwayTraffic:3499,trafficLights:2599},checkoutMode='test';const showPrice=()=>{const kind=jobTypeInputs.find(input=>input.checked)?.value,amount=kind==='portable-traffic-lights'?checkoutPrices.trafficLights:checkoutPrices.motorwayTraffic;price=new Intl.NumberFormat('en-GB',{style:'currency',currency:'GBP'}).format(amount/100);document.querySelector('#total')!.textContent=`Total: ${price}${checkoutMode==='test'?' — TEST CHECKOUT, no real payment':''}`;};fetch('/api/safework/checkout').then(r=>r.json()).then(c=>{checkoutPrices=c.prices||checkoutPrices;checkoutMode=c.mode;showPrice();});jobTypeInputs.forEach(input=>input.addEventListener('change',showPrice));showPrice();document.querySelector('#edit')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{form.hidden=false;confirmation.hidden=true});document.querySelector('#pay')!.addEventListener('click',async()=>{msg.textContent='Opening your order…';try{const r=await fetch('/api/safework/checkout',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)}),d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error);(document.querySelector('#order-link') as HTMLAnchorElement).href=d.returnUrl;(document.querySelector('#stripe-link') as HTMLAnchorElement).href=d.url;confirmation.hidden=true;document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#recovery')!.hidden=false;msg.textContent='Order saved. Keep the private link, then continue to Stripe.';}catch(e){msg.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Checkout failed.';}});
</script>
<style>body{background:#071421;color:#eef6f2}.workspace{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:auto;padding:42px 0 70px}.workspace>a{color:#d9f3e6}.eyebrow{color:#ff9a48;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.13em}.intro{max-width:820px;font-size:18px}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;padding:0;list-style:none}.steps li{background:#fff;color:#071421;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:800}.steps b{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;width:26px;height:26px;margin-right:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff8129}form,#confirmation,#recovery{background:#fff;color:#102d23;border-radius:12px;padding:30px;margin-top:24px}fieldset{border:1px solid #bfd0c6;border-radius:9px;margin:0 0 25px;padding:22px}legend{padding:0 10px;color:#126747;font-size:22px;font-weight:900}.grid,.ticks,.job-type-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.ticks{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);margin-bottom:20px}.ticks label,.check,.job-type-options label{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start}.job-type{border:2px solid #f57f20;background:#fff9f2}.job-type-options label{padding:18px;border:1px solid #e1b58e;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer}.job-type-options input{margin-top:4px}.job-type-options strong,.job-type-options small{display:block}.job-type-options small{margin-top:7px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.45}.field-help{margin:-8px 0 20px;padding:12px;background:#eff7f2;border-left:4px solid #18815c}.red-book{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:0 0 20px;padding:18px;border:2px solid #18815c;border-radius:8px;background:#eff7f2}.red-book strong{font-size:18px}.red-book span:before{content:'✓';margin-right:8px;color:#126747;font-weight:900}label{display:block;font-weight:750}label span{font-weight:400}input:not([type=checkbox]):not([type=radio]),select,textarea{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:7px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #9eb4a8;border-radius:5px;font:inherit}textarea{resize:vertical}button,.button{display:inline-block;background:#f57f20;color:#071421;border:0;border-radius:5px;padding:14px 20px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.secondary{background:#dfe8e3}.notice{border:2px solid #f57f20;background:#fff6ec;padding:16px;margin:20px 0}.check{margin:15px 0;font-weight:500}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font:inherit}a{color:inherit}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:720px){.grid,.ticks,.steps,.job-type-options{grid-template-columns:1fr}form{padding:18px}fieldset{padding:16px}}</style></body></html>
